    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109056" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπο-ρράπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>patch,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεώμενος ὑπερραμμένον τὸν χιτῶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					17.5.7
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάδος] τὸν πυθμένα ὑπέραπται</span>
			<i>has a mend</i> in the bottom, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1542.22
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαῦλα ὑπέρραπτο ὑποδήματα</span>
			<i>was wearing patched</i> shoes, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				20.237b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. λόγον</span>
			<i>make up</i> a story, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				537
			</span></i>.</div>
